{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>41歲唐禹哲2023年底在內地節目公開向與小13歲混血千金妻子蘇小軒求婚後，隨後曝光兩人已育有1子，日前小倆口迎來第二胎寶貝女兒，雖然雙方一直沒有公開確切的登記結婚時間點。</p><p>8月16日蘇小軒透過社群曬出絕美婚紗照，並喊：</p><figure><img alt=\"唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165974064590753792361954.jpeg/mfx8LX45obGLDpu_4fWTpNEODleZS96fAgiQsgIIkLI\"/><figcaption>唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><p>更多唐禹哲、蘇小軒的絕美婚紗照與日常相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165974477150883840731564.jpeg/XxAkiXPVtbjWUp2Q0pQhL6nSSbuxW7N4vkh5db5IeXU\"/><figcaption>唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165974480011530240029431.jpeg/kHrk9duJVLRnFHdpgQ1ZPjKSWDvNR0d77Fsi-OxbIvg\"/><figcaption>唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165974482733764608195748.jpeg/ZH1l-FLHRPAqo8YFt4NpwhQVtVfVlc5Q2hN2gNoTdoA\"/><figcaption>唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165974485657325568734216.jpeg/Yxxbc9hx0YNvrOYihd0znE8ZgIMoAkf-zWPJmM1jyZg\"/><figcaption>唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165974488257925120724906.jpeg/c-87TRxZedYJWbmCPvc0IOeJ1PvgAwmoB_gXWAf4F1g\"/><figcaption>唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165974468904882176140972.jpeg/RfF1Ke72hb6pgnpSJ0HlX8hujBmgtBOK_ppGsP6aRrA\"/><figcaption>唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165974471866191872691874.jpeg/9NNcGey7iyiQzkQP7YjfnZRQaBcH0nLh0vaxzdL2sc0\"/><figcaption>唐禹哲、蘇小軒絕美婚紗照唯美浪漫。（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165976653478760448492175.jpeg/T5U18Nd7j3jqHk38WtlheFHcAULPTc1HZfESVWXxElU\"/><figcaption>蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165976656100331520478302.jpeg/aJdZHUzYAdmHvgrQtQ9DNhSQC26NjFt-xcsGR8XLBkc\"/><figcaption>蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165976658638016512965147.jpeg/JnxNsjZwJjBlald8q1Exn2_Bx5vJNJ8RMyPfDTMj3w0\"/><figcaption>蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165976661230227456871490.jpeg/a8rd6OqfhB5TFJrIEBNuHFymvN45M7si8gckX_IHJF8\"/><figcaption>蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165976664044736512496250.jpeg/auMvJgszzcTZbPSCfKuJpS-42vaCQAa4HBSXwhwUl8I\"/><figcaption>蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165976646763679744068713.jpeg/46wJYGfXvjXGdHlHrIVWSAkEWKuP62-xWFd6lVhXepU\"/><figcaption>蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165976649586577408938645.jpeg/zbBTaDb8eok7IrfIopA9ZHdLFgUybNMd8mbjSPJm40g\"/><figcaption>蘇小軒（Instagram@xiaoxuansu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唐禹哲（IG@dt_0902）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805696555945984451087.jpeg/EgihfqehWJz29M2htiyD3nGvzEZUMIKdb1jhSG9Y4Ug\"/><figcaption>唐禹哲（IG@dt_0902）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唐禹哲（IG@dt_0902）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805692269105152958176.jpeg/JtZL5TuNa77VXCXOQQLIKBVgBWPhAIBJUt_GdFLfxnQ\"/><figcaption>唐禹哲（IG@dt_0902）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唐禹哲（IG@dt_0902）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805694345416704598126.jpeg/o7nXwcaZan7I6AEJ_AbUaHTcO5xNpxzWM2eq5zNnquc\"/><figcaption>唐禹哲（IG@dt_0902）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唐禹哲（IG@dt_0902）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805686707195904978256.jpeg/Z8HaiPFU1KIwYcGhHVitG3riaMrl-NpCHhPxcx4T8XM\"/><figcaption>唐禹哲（IG@dt_0902）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唐禹哲（IG@dt_0902）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133805689202937856613042.jpeg/hnu1QvGpq5qQNUnFxvUP8CrSbRc9AmkeNTa7vzU2u78\"/><figcaption>唐禹哲（IG@dt_0902）</figcaption></figure><p>照片中，蘇小軒一襲米白色削肩蕾絲婚紗，勾勒出姣好身材，唐禹哲筆挺西裝，夫妻高顏值外表，一款深情對望照，猶如偶像劇般唯美浪漫。</p><p>蘇小軒在文章開頭便提到「期待好久的婚紗照」，不忘感性對老公吐露愛意，「從第一眼看到對方，就沒有分開過」，更直言彼此除了工作以外的時間，小倆口總是黏在一起，甜蜜直呼彼此：「所有的生活、相處，都契合的像雙胞胎。」更真情告白唐禹哲：</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：昆凌33歲生日周杰倫高調放閃　燭光晚宴告白「永遠愛妳」粉碎謠言】周杰倫為愛妻昆凌慶祝33歲生日。（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164512488851509248297841.jpeg/0WLaBPuGAvmQ73fZ_k-FAQysteNW9RHk8fZqF_H2ahc\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：昆凌33歲生日周杰倫高調放閃　燭光晚宴告白「永遠愛妳」粉碎謠言】周杰倫為愛妻昆凌慶祝33歲生日。（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周杰倫為愛妻昆凌慶祝33歲生日。（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164513667299938304402581.jpeg/vVXstg684ox60BznGp0XgsazeHp3hy30k_6slpP-rJY\"/><figcaption>周杰倫為愛妻昆凌慶祝33歲生日。（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周杰倫為愛妻昆凌慶祝33歲生日。（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164513669741154304639547.jpeg/Js6tlPEMu6YjyIA6Tl2aFet8SwsHQe5vP--aYT_vmmE\"/><figcaption>周杰倫為愛妻昆凌慶祝33歲生日。（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周杰倫為愛妻昆凌慶祝33歲生日。（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164513672605995008703659.jpeg/aV9R-JHQXzqGM7TQ0SG4drPPjh6JQsmjT6HA_U-hwP0\"/><figcaption>周杰倫為愛妻昆凌慶祝33歲生日。（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周杰倫在晚宴的佈置相當用心（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164513675139485696398751.jpeg/s9Gfua5oFgqT4tMmtGnzyHHbrKKGNbZq_7_ouP-_6Lg\"/><figcaption>周杰倫在晚宴的佈置相當用心（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周杰倫在晚宴的佈置相當用心（Instagram@jaychou）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164513678344065024216084.jpeg/ES8GZWp5obkzz7MHaj5bb-ALOAgPa52LA-WPLQPljy0\"/><figcaption>周杰倫在晚宴的佈置相當用心（Instagram@jaychou）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周杰倫在晚宴的佈置相當用心（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164513638216634368653280.png/kyWCe_iKdoUql5yeMvTU3TMmYDfsSXAlJQcLDCUHCww\"/><figcaption>周杰倫在晚宴的佈置相當用心（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周杰倫在晚宴的佈置相當用心（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164513640808845312862590.png/aC15AFOIdztYpuWDSVm9UX2Tq-txH6SFInye1CJ8ntQ\"/><figcaption>周杰倫在晚宴的佈置相當用心（Instagram@hannah_quinlivan）</figcaption></figure><p>小刀遭爆2年前已離婚　為5566復出「隱瞞婚變」</p><p>馬國畢13年還債4500萬！ 黃慧婷曝最深感觸：不要貪心，也不要不甘心</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T06:40:14.113124+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1347,"images":28,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}